{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30002_01_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:501c06e0562cb25a4ec3ea8949a28be610e2dc319ec950700948d258f2fa26e3",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_c:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1cb9240ac187be9e1c5699263ffaebab73add517b55614043037acddbb5ee1ac",
      "text": "校舍后方",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_c:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c799ca2ea33f6941508129c66966c60f506005c34c12a42beb6c04ceef07b8e",
      "text": "好——勒，赶紧挖吧！\n我记得是埋在这附近了吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_c:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2abddfbbd73b8f35bc761cb381a8ae297524b7816606ef49989e52b117fbbcb4",
      "text": "Oh！停下停下，预备齐一起挖☆\n比比看谁先找到，是一场race哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_c:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e15b4586d596334e6720c0e547e2d63573254bd188053242e8e3156ae60c0500",
      "text": "……哎呀哎呀，类还真是有活力啊。\n我就在这儿参观好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_c:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26c5f665c98413573c03250207e1f1d729b5c9fde27031ff791f6d8ec5b05b8d",
      "text": "真是的，快来帮忙啦。老师当了偶像之后，\n体力多少也长进了一点吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_c:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1af81cb625dc50fe4fcaab13655236b219542c075aecebd6e2d84088622a0781",
      "text": "哎～这个嘛。我也一把年纪了，\n发育期早就过了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_c:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:959f6ff1d4239079dc0a66f6918e2f94b4b09143cb9fddad8a73a2b2a0340e0c",
      "text": "不，山下君通过课程训练，\n确实有所成长。尽管保持自信就好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_c:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8d047e348522b9e9f9b8f6a87a5fa010662bbc5b321fe9bc2dcc4315c0b8f73",
      "text": "啊哈哈……当着学生的面被这么说真不好意思。\n总而言之，看来我也稍微有点长进呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_c:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff97cc388220d3ddf727cb659d741f6a6e4f8d1e24afbbbd8b2ab7978c41b412",
      "text": "嘿。既然这样……\n老师，你最近赌马赢了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_c:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d5de81ca501d0dccd727aa183318bab46fa935041245459c3fdea6a331e4ed6",
      "text": "呃，戳到痛处了啊。赌马这事嘛，\n比起我的长进，主要还是看当下的运气和时机……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_c:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:216b0e85c414cd9043e7d4cb3448447fec724f6a8542e799b63beae97a283080",
      "text": "……等等，山下君。\n你连对学生也聊赌博的话题吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_c:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a092c4303098cd83491e36ac6994508aaeafd38c70eed6ce99db8212882f83b7",
      "text": "哎呀，那不是过去的事了嘛，过去的事！\n比起那个，类那边情况怎么样了～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_c:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7add8941c8b0a5186ca83181608ea8cab95e399b30fbcd214f1df7eedac0f534",
      "text": "Wow！大家快看，挖出东西来了！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
